  <h1>DeepSeek Sparse Attention: O(L²) → O(L·k)</h1>
  <p class="lead">Dense attention attends to every token in the context — burning quadratic FLOPs as sequences grow. DSA breaks that wall: a tiny <em>lightning indexer</em> scores the whole context cheaply, then the main attention runs on just the top-k most relevant tokens. At 128K context with k=2048, that's attending to 1.6% of tokens while matching full-attention quality.</p>
