<p>Decoding (autoregressive token generation) also benefits substantially — the paper shows roughly a 4× cost difference at 128K context for decoding, as DSA reduces the KV cache reads per step.</p>

<h3>Quality benchmarks: no regression</h3>
<p>The quality story is equally strong. DeepSeek-V3.2-Exp (the base DSA checkpoint before post-training) was evaluated against DeepSeek-V3.1-Terminus on all standard benchmarks. The comparison found no significant degradation on short-context tasks. On long-context specifically:</p>

